KONOHAGAKURE — SQUAD ROSTER: TEAM GUY

Jonin-sensei: Might Guy (taijutsu master; rival of Kakashi Hatake)
Genin/Chunin:
- Rock Lee — pure taijutsu; unable to use ninjutsu or genjutsu; Eight Gates training. Guy's protege.
- Hyuga, Neji — Byakugan; Gentle Fist; Branch house prodigy. "Genius of the Hyuga."
- Tenten — weapons specialist; vast armory via sealing scrolls.

Formation notes: A close-combat and mid-range team. Neji's Byakugan defense, Lee's overwhelming taijutsu, and Tenten's ranged weaponry cover all engagement distances. One year senior to the current rookie genin teams.

Status: Active.
